{"code":"PK06","wikidata":"Q123537238","wikipedia":{"en":"Yaek Pak Kret MRT station","th":"สถานีแยกปากเกร็ด"},"summary":{"en":"Yaek Pak Kret station is a Bangkok MRT station on the Pink Line. The station is located on Chaeng Watthana Road in Pak Kret district, Nonthaburi province. The station has four exits and is the closest station for Pak Kret city municipality.","th":"สถานีแยกปากเกร็ด เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้ามหานครแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางสายสีชมพู ตั้งอยู่ทางทิศตะวันออกเฉียงใต้ของทางแยกปากเกร็ดในพื้นที่อำเภอปากเกร็ด จังหวัดนนทบุรี"},"opened":"2023-11-21","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c3/MRT_Pink_Line_Yaek_Pak_Kret_Station_20231125-6.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Yaek_Pak_Kret_Station_20231125-6.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Yaek_Pak_Kret_Station_20231125-6.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Bangkok_MRT_Pink_Line_Monorail_PM20_Yeak_Pak_Kret.jpg/960px-Bangkok_MRT_Pink_Line_Monorail_PM20_Yeak_Pak_Kret.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bangkok_MRT_Pink_Line_Monorail_PM20_Yeak_Pak_Kret.jpg","author":"Takeshi Aida","license":"CC BY-SA 2.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6f/MRT_Pink_Line_Yaek_Pak_Kret_Station_20231125-1.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Yaek_Pak_Kret_Station_20231125-1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Yaek_Pak_Kret_Station_20231125-1.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bc/MRT_Pink_Line_Yaek_Pak_Kret_Station_20231125-2.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Yaek_Pak_Kret_Station_20231125-2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&